  "body": "The accepted four-child theorem returns the same six-clause repair interface, extending recursive composition to finite ordered trees of internal arity 2, 3, or 4 with total excursion \u22641 under the frozen native admissibility rules.\n\nImplementation includes exact 15-region feasibility, fixed-root clearance, guarded q1/q2 expansion/contraction, q3 complementary-cover reconfiguration, q4 disjoint role exchange, and an independent support-set verifier. The frozen F/R/N/M domain is preserved; unsafe-transport examples are expected controls, not nonunit obstructions.\n\nPrimary and independent fresh reproduction passed at source 433b3c2e9ffb34e08e34b425d5c56dc1b8a851cf in [run36944252886](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36944252886): 1,150 inherited plus43 current checks each, 2,863 frozen records and34,234 verified primitive moves. All45 scientific files match byte for byte; all42 inherited outputs match the integrated baseline. Original API archives were independently downloaded, digest/source/log audited, and retained in verified chunks. Publication e84643fdb667e28c41018a56c3422f4b90ef5160 has363 audited manifest entries with unchanged source and inherited tree.\n\nAnalytical review and independent whole-source review are complete. Two Important source-review findings were corrected with preserved RED\u2192GREEN evidence. The intermediate imported-TestCase discovery error was rejected and preserved before the proper RED gate. First definitive preflight at51773cc88f62669176b9cc38837a02a2622188e2 stopped before science on a Python3.12/Python3.11 AST serialization mismatch; source hashes matched. Source433 prospectively versions the portable AST format, adds the pinned-runtime regression and retains early-failure status/log evidence. No proof, scientific domain, target or inherited source was weakened.\n\nIndependent exact-head review APPROVED e84643fdb667e28c41018a56c3422f4b90ef5160 into b6bf95798ec5892963c29f4020f8b75069fd2e3b, with no outstanding findings. The review identified and closed one archival gap: the standalone initial preflight ZIP is now retained with API provenance on the audit branch (f4361758285e2ae44afdf44cd1c66351744d2b62). [Independent approval and retention record](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/blob/b32b2fc6e7487117bb8ab0acc7fe6fb87d66f9c1/ResearchHistory/UQCF-GEM/audits/v16.53/premerge-e84643f/INDEPENDENT_EXACT_HEAD_REVIEW.md) was read back exactly. Merged as f6d4d792aa6ec1d7c058eeb21fa3a4de267dacb8 with verified ordered parents and publication-tree equality. Integrated CI36946472199 and actual-merge preflight passed. Full [actual-merge replay36946472173](https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36946472173) is running; independent durable receipt remains required. Not yet CLOSED/CERTIFIED.\n\nAll numerical execution is on GitHub. PROGRESS.md records rulings and preserved failure evidence. Arity\u22655 and physical interpretation remain outside scope.",
